  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Quantum Computing for High-Energy Physics : State of the Art and Challenges (2024) in RWTH Publications. SDG alignment: Affordable and clean energy.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Quantum Computing for High-Energy Physics : State of the Art and Challenges (2024) in RWTH Publications is authored by Di Meglio, Alberto, Jansen, Karl and Tavernelli, Ivano. Topics: Quantum computer, Physics, State (computer science), Computer science and Theoretical physics.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">No citations yet.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Limited online visibility beyond citations.</p>",
